.DS_Store

# Training data is generated, not authored: `tools/make_dataset.py` rebuilds it
# from a seed in a few minutes. Keeping several megabytes of it in history -
# again on every rebuild - costs more than making it again.
data/*.jsonl
data/by-genre/
# Pages fetched from itch.io, kept so a re-run costs their server nothing.
data/itch-cache/
data/vocab-gap.json
# Levels imported from elsewhere. Deliberately not in the repository: see
# "Where the levels come from" in docs/training.md - these are other people's
# games, and the tools to fetch them are here instead of the fetched result.
data/study/
runs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
